  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An Operational Framework for All-Day Lower Secondary Schools in Cyprus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will develop an operational framework for the institutionalisation of all-day schooling at the lower secondary education level. It will (1) improve student academic achievement by providing students with additional hours in school to allow them to work on their homework with help from teachers, along with additional trainings in science, technology, mathematics, arts, Greek language, and cultures; (2) pay special attention to groups that are at high risk of early school-leaving; (3) support students to gain a wide range of socio-emotional skills, for example critical thinking, teamwork, responsibility, resilience, and compassion.</narrative>
  </description>
